<%- include('partials/header', {title: 'Home - CSCE 331 Lab Activity'}) %>

<div class="card">
    <h2>Welcome to <%= name %>'s Homepage</h2>
    <p>This web application is built for the <strong>CSCE 331 Lab Activity</strong> demonstrating full-stack server-side development with Node.js, Express.js, PostgreSQL (via <code>pg.Pool</code>), and EJS templating.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h2>Lab Evidence & Checklist for TA Review</h2>
    <div class="grid">
        <div class="grid-item">
            <span class="badge badge-success">Task 1 Verified</span>
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">PostgreSQL Connection</h3>
            <p>Node.js connects securely to PostgreSQL using connection pooling (<code>pg.Pool</code>) and environment variables via <code>dotenv</code>.</p>
            <a href="/user" class="btn">View /user Route</a>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-item">
            <span class="badge badge-success">Task 2 Verified</span>
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">.gitignore Best Practice</h3>
            <p>Database credentials in <code>.env</code> and dependencies in <code>node_modules/</code> are strictly excluded from source control. A sanitized <code>.env.example</code> is tracked.</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #4b5563;">git status &rarr; .env is untracked &amp; ignored</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-item">
            <span class="badge badge-success">Task 3 Verified</span>
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Hosted Code Docs</h3>
            <p>Interactive Javadoc documentation for the POS project is actively hosted and viewable in the browser.</p>
            <a href="/docs" target="_blank" class="btn">Browse Javadoc &rarr;</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h2>Database Live Data Endpoints</h2>
    <p>Select any route below to query the live <code>troupe_04_db</code> PostgreSQL instance:</p>
    <ul style="margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.75rem;">
        <li><a href="/user" style="font-weight: 600;">/user</a>: Queries the <code>teammembers</code> table (Student Name, Section, Role, Favorite Movie).</li>
        <li><a href="/products" style="font-weight: 600;">/products</a>: Queries the <code>products</code> table from our POS database.</li>
        <li><a href="/inventory" style="font-weight: 600;">/inventory</a>: Queries the <code>inventory</code> table showing live ingredient stock levels.</li>
        <li><a href="/docs" target="_blank" style="font-weight: 600;">/docs</a>: Serves the full Javadoc suite generated from our POS source code.</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
